# This project ships .lang/.json files whose bytes are the deliverable.
#
# Minecraft 1.12.2 splits tooltips on the literal two-character sequence \n;
# a real U+000A inside a .lang value terminates the entry instead, so the rest
# of the line silently vanishes in game. Release artifacts are also verified by
# SHA256, so any end-of-line rewrite by git would both corrupt content and
# invalidate every published checksum.
#
# Therefore: git must never translate line endings in this repository.
* -text
